{"speciesId":30,"names":{"fr":"Nidorina","es":"Nidorina","en":"Nidorina","ja":"ニドリーナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"The female's horn develops slowly. Prefers physical attacks such as clawing and biting."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"The female's horn develops slowly. Prefers physical attacks such as clawing and biting."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"When resting deep in its burrow, its thorns always retract. This is proof that it is relaxed."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When feeding its young, it first chews and tender­ izes the food, then spits it out for the offspring."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It has a calm and caring nature. Because its horn grows slowly, it prefers not to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It has a docile nature. If it is threatened with attack, it raises the barbs that are all over its body."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When NIDORINA are with their friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. This POKéMON appears to become nervous if separated from the others."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When NIDORINA are with their friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. This POKéMON appears to become nervous if separated from the others."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"When it is with its friends or family, its barbs are tucked away to prevent injury. It appears to become nervous if separated from the others."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The female has a gentle temperament. It emits ultrasonic cries that have the power to befuddle foes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The female’s horns develop slowly. Prefers physical attacks such as clawing and biting."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO’s."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO’s."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO’s."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When feeding its young, it first chews the food into a paste, then spits it out for the offspring."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has a calm and caring nature. Because its horn grows slowly, it prefers not to fight."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon dresse ses piquants en cas de danger. Ils poussent moins vite que ceux de Nidorino."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon dresse ses piquants en cas de danger. Ils poussent moins vite que ceux de Nidorino."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La femelle a un tempérament doux. Elle émet des cris ultrasoniques capables de déstabiliser ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene un carácter afable. Emite ondas ultrasónicas para confundir al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The female has a gentle temperament. It emits ultrasonic cries that have the power to befuddle foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"メスなので 性格は 温厚。 口から 出す 超音波は 相手を まどわす 力がある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pour nourrir ses petits, il mâche les aliments pour les rendre tendres et il les recrache à ses bébés."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando alimenta a sus crías, primero mastica y ablanda la comida y luego la escupe para su prole."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When feeding its young, it first chews the food into a paste, then spits it out for the offspring."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"子供に エサを 分け与えるとき 親が かみくだき やわらかくした エサを 吐き戻して 与える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsqu’un Nidorina est avec ses amis ou sa famille, il replie ses pointes pour ne pas blesser ses proches. Ce Pokémon devient vite nerveux lorsqu’il est séparé de son groupe."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando están en familia o con sus amigos, esconden las púas para evitar accidentes. Según parece, se alteran bastante si se separan del grupo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Nidorina are with their friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. This Pokémon appears to become nervous if separated from the others."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"仲間や 家族と 一緒の ときは お互い 傷つかないように トゲが 引っ込んでいる。 仲間から 離れると 不安に なるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsqu’un Nidorina est avec ses amis ou sa famille, il replie ses pointes pour ne pas blesser ses proches. Ce Pokémon devient vite nerveux lorsqu’il est séparé de son groupe."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando están en familia o con sus amigos, esconden las púas para evitar accidentes. Según parece, se alteran bastante si se separan del grupo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Nidorina are with their friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. This Pokémon appears to become nervous if separated from the others."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"仲間や 家族と 一緒の ときは お互い 傷つかないように トゲが 引っ込んでいる。 仲間から 離れると 不安に なるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Quand ce Pokémon s’abrite au fond de son terrier, ses cornes se rétractent. C’est signe qu’il est détendu."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Mientras se cobija en su madriguera, retrae las púas, señal inequívoca de que se siente a salvo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"When resting deep in its burrow, its barbs always retract. This is proof that it is relaxed."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"巣穴の 奥に いるときは 必ず トゲトゲが 引っこむ。 リラックスしている 証拠だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Quand ce Pokémon s’abrite au fond de son terrier, ses cornes se rétractent. C’est signe qu’il est détendu."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Mientras se cobija en su madriguera, retrae las púas, señal inequívoca de que se siente a salvo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"When resting deep in its burrow, its barbs always retract. This is proof that it is relaxed."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"巣穴の 奥に いるときは 必ず トゲトゲが 引っこむ。 リラックスしている 証拠だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On pense que sa corne frontale s’est atrophiée pour lui permettre de nourrir ses petits sans les blesser."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se cree que el cuerno de la frente se le ha atrofiado para evitar herir a sus crías al alimentarlas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The horn on its head has atrophied. It’s thought that this happens so Nidorina’s children won’t get poked while their mother is feeding them."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"額の ツノは 子どもに エサを 与えるときに 刺さらないよう 退化したと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Si un danger menace le groupe, ces Pokémon se réunissent et l’affrontent en émettant des ultrasons en chœur."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando el peligro se cierne sobre la manada, los miembros unen fuerzas para defenderse emitiendo un coro de ondas ultrasónicas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"If the group is threatened, these Pokémon will band together to assault enemies with a chorus of ultrasonic waves."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"群れに 危険が せまると 仲間で 結束して 超音波の 大合唱を おみまいするぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":30,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[1,"level-up",8],[2,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",8],[3,"level-up",8],[4,"level-up",8],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",8],[29,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[1,"level-up",50],[2,"level-up",12],[3,"level-up",12],[4,"level-up",12],[5,"level-up",12],[6,"level-up",12],[7,"level-up",12],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",12],[13,"level-up",12],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[19,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",29],[23,"level-up",29],[28,"level-up",50],[29,"level-up",50]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"horn-drill","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":